[160.257474, "o", "  \u001b[36m●\u001b[0m \u001b[1mBash\u001b[0m \u001b[2mcd /demo/Alloy; opticli search \"Partners\" --in names 2>&1 | head -c 3000\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[163.66478, "o", "  \u001b[36m●\u001b[0m \u001b[1mBash\u001b[0m \u001b[2mopticli search \"Partners\" --in names\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[167.66478, "o", "  \u001b[36m●\u001b[0m \u001b[1mBash\u001b[0m \u001b[2mopticli access 122; echo; opticli get 122; echo; opticli tree 122 --depth 3\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[171.66478, "o", "  \u001b[36m●\u001b[0m \u001b[1mBash\u001b[0m \u001b[2mopticli get 125; echo; opticli access 125; echo; opticli get 126; echo; opticli versions 122 --limit 5; echo; opticli versions 12\u001b[2m…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[175.66478, "o", "\r\n"]
[175.664913, "o", "  **Who can read it:** Only signed-in users. The Partners page (`/en/partners/`, ref 122) has its own access rights, not inherited from the parent:\r\n  Authenticated gets Read and Administrators get Full Access. Everyone and anonymous visitors have no rights, so the public can't see it. Partner training\r\n  inherits the same rights from Partners.\r\n  \r\n  **What's on it (published version 122_146):**\r\n  - The heading \"Welcome, Alloy partners\" and a short intro that links to `alloy-price-list-2026.pdf` and mentions the certification programme.\r\n  - One teaser block, \"Get certified\" (\"Free online training for Alloy partners.\"), with the handshake image. It links to the Partner training page.\r\n  - One child page: Partner training.\r\n  - The page also has the short address `/resellers` and the categories Meet, Plan and Track.\r\n  \r\n  **Where Partner training links:** `/en/partners/partner-training/` has no content of its own. It's set up as a shortcut to the external address\r\n  **https://academy.example.com/alloy**, which opens in a new tab. So both the menu item and the teaser end up at that external site.\r\n  \r\n"]
[175.664951, "o", "  Neither page has unpublished drafts. All of this was last saved today at about 12:30 UTC by the `opticli` user.\r\n"]
[179.664951, "o", "\u001b[32m\u001b[1m/demo/Alloy\u001b[0m \u001b[36m❯\u001b[0m o"]
